──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ETHICAL USE AND SCOPE STATEMENT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This software is designed exclusively for defensive cybersecurity education
in isolated local laboratory environments.

AUTHORIZED USE:
  • Running on your own machine (localhost)
  • Running in a private, isolated virtual lab network you own and control
  • Educational exploration of cybersecurity concepts
  • Portfolio demonstration

PROHIBITED USE:
  • Scanning, probing, or attacking systems you do not own
  • Scanning, probing, or attacking public IP addresses or domains
  • Any activity that violates applicable computer fraud or abuse laws
  • Any unauthorized access to third-party networks or systems

The vulnerable web application component is intentionally flawed for
educational purposes only. It must never be deployed on a public-facing
server or network interface.

By using this software, you agree to restrict all activities to systems
for which you have explicit written authorization.
